# Environment variables for deployment
# Only set these if you need to override defaults

# 🔑 SECRETS - Add these to GitHub Secrets for deployment:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
# DB_PASSWORD=your-database-password

# 🌐 DATABASE - Set these when deploying to a specific database:
# DB_HOST=your-database-host.com
# DB_USERNAME=your-db-user  
# DB_NAME=your-database-name

# ⚙️ OPTIONAL - Only set if you need different values:
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id (has default)
# INITIAL_ADMINS=email1,email2 (has default)  
# ML_ENDPOINT=your-ml-endpoint (has default)
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-admin-pass (has default)
# SERVER_PORT=8080 (has default)